: "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_28369212172730796_5258581881626541407_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CNIYYn1VTh4Q7kNvwHWmFZJ&_nc_oc=AdqxUjqmFXHZiySiTABXlI4xxJMBeebh7ogxpqxqTXq_-jyTdZbWwus-R8vxAek9Mdc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPnvNv8TSeWyQn6mMHWLsiWlp5KNAq9oX104oGavskaUw&oe=6AE34B87"}, {"file_name": "store-04-source-assembly.png", "id": "1548633643226364", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1548633646559697_7297799975838773294_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4SJD_q7u8YYQ7kNvwF08v-W&_nc_oc=AdptS3RcppXq4k0YrsXMVCgXiBakULQH0vQiDv9S-I4DpGYiU148kf71jSZ3COnXbzE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPc8BMXWg0Wau0GYbs-UEVnYttHDo3avVYD8yJOt99Tow&oe=6AE34A20"}, {"file_name": "store-03-blue-hologram.png", "id": "1160826089604529", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_1160826092937862_5729086189951941997_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LFbzFP6C6i4Q7kNvwHFKeM4&_nc_oc=AdrGlD0zPs3F24f-ybkVDo5yNayRrmKU_KCQxJShkddhDryB9ojK5DrN3NWjPdPRdRA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOXFz-IdXl3mckhEvITLEkIbsghHuMGTwCh8KeBHEs23Q&oe=6AE353A2"}, {"file_name": "store-06-source-joints.png", "id": "1613021433699869", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1613021437033202_467147905405238580_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4018zVjpYtwQ7kNvwFwFsY0&_nc_oc=AdqB2CcnEDbmSz0blIdSNnuScsAW11zI1_wxUM-UL2P3FZY5xhoq_oh52Ahvojiwt0A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMzHL-OhexlfoU0Se3xCdNdtxNNjYJ2mma8nlxwsa4anw&oe=6AE34241"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover.png", "id": "2160832664821064", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_2160832668154397_1522314912689723401_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l-9XZK9wVNQQ7kNvwGqDOq5&_nc_oc=Adp20FUqdktNEjbTsvgBQtFBH9BVRowfuJxfreeQ_nLO6SFsRHXyMr47fKtpifF9HQc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNF8ThsmRvi4Cw_xgWtDr2fFbXrohUP8IpbMKrIrbBEsg&oe=6AE36892"}, "display_name": "RobotAtlas", "keywords": ["Robot", "3D", "Holo", "Humanoid", "Machines"], "long_description": "Explore published robot models in 3D.\n\nRobot Atlas is an independent visualization app by Nebulytic for Meta Quest 3. Browse 71 models grouped by source company, then inspect one on a movable glass base. Resize the rack, toolbar and model to suit your space.\n\nChoose passthrough, Studio or Black. Switch between full source colour, colour hologram, blue hologram, see-through and exploded assembly views. Exploded view separates only the parts actually included in a source; it does not reveal missing geometry.\n\n70 models use exterior or simplified simulation geometry. ODRI Bolt contains a partial engineering assembly, without complete wiring, battery, camera or factory documentation. Detailed internal systems are generally absent. Published units and materials are source data, not certified real-world dimensions or finishes.\n\nThe UR5e supports six verified source-defined joints for kinematic inspection. Import your own self-contained static GLB files (up to 64 MiB and 250,000 triangles). Imports remain on your headset; skinned, animated and compressed models are unsupported.\n\nYou purchase the viewer software. Third-party models remain under their original licences, with credits in the app. Source names identify the robots; no manufacturer endorsement is implied. Internet is needed for uncached collection models.\n", "short_description": "View 71 published robot models in mixed reality or a virtual room. Rotate, resize, change visual style and separate source parts. Import your own static GLB files. Most included sources show exterior or simplified simulation geometry; detailed internals are generally absent.\n"}]}, "developer